{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "The Stage 2 marquee row at the goal surface. 3_000_000_000 + 2_000_000_000\noverflows uint(uint.MaxValue ~ 4.29e9). Under Way 3 the addition promotes\nto BigInteger, computes 5_000_000_000, and narrows the result to long —\nno silent uint wrap. The goal test pins the sum's value; the kind-on-the-\nresult test (`%sum.Type.Kind%` == \"long\") sits in C# NumberArithmeticTests.",
